{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":101099,"seasonNumber":3},"checkedAt":1793380380421,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":3,"name":{"value":"Stagione 3","language":"it-IT"},"year":2022,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9DIvSykpvrr7ych5v4YMVDTg3wC.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"3810025","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"传闻人心有悔，悔重如海，生拈花，生大悔之心者可召之。 江湖第一剑客封无乐为何要召唤拈花？ 桃夭初到京师又发生了哪些有趣的故事呢？ 桃夭和伙伴们的京师之旅正式开启，谁料初到京师竟然惨遭抢劫，幸而得到剑客封无乐的相助，桃夭察觉封无乐身患重病却有心事未了，难道救妖不救人的桃夭要开始救人了么？","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-07-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/epmujrJz7etdyWH8A2ovresPUQ1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/epmujrJz7etdyWH8A2ovresPUQ1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/3/episode/1"},{"id":"3810026","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"拈花一现，契约既成，想知道封无乐和芽芽之间有哪些温暖又遗憾的回忆吗？ 封无乐在拈花的帮助下再次和芽芽相见，两人泪流满面回忆过往，芽芽从来没恨过封无乐，封无乐的心结也就此打开......","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-07-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n5e7Mx14tqg3ZVUFqMFasOfb4s7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n5e7Mx14tqg3ZVUFqMFasOfb4s7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/3/episode/2"},{"id":"3850797","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"桃夭等人因资金短缺，决定租下京城一处破房子。 温和好客的同院租客陈白水为何突然性情大变？ 这背后究竟有哪些隐情？ 虎落平阳被犬欺，桃夭京师被蛇欺，这柳公子做饭也太难吃了，幸亏隔壁的邻居陈白水好心施舍，但是他接下来的举动却令人费解，不知磨牙能否脱险？","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-08-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uuASVgWNVtBTsE4ZXUAPV2Pnvpg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uuASVgWNVtBTsE4ZXUAPV2Pnvpg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/3/episode/3"},{"id":"3850798","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"原来妖怪非非千里召唤桃夭，竟是为了让她杀掉自己，非非和陈白水之间，到底有什么渊源？ 「陈白水，我想和你一起走」非非因陈白水曾有恩于她，而想要报恩，但是却变得事与愿违。 非非之前经历过哪些事情，为何又要请求桃夭杀掉自己？","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-08-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":21,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qk607ZhIpXIeKwc0tYkK7eMBgdw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qk607ZhIpXIeKwc0tYkK7eMBgdw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/3/episode/4"},{"id":"3850800","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"司府诚招杂役一名，男女不限，桃夭就此开启打工之旅，不过为何众人都说司府不是什么好地方？ 在司府的小妖怪云阳的登场，又会带来什么样的故事？ 桃夭司府打工的初体验似乎并没有那么顺利，喂马的工作也并没有那么轻松，好在有丁三四的帮忙，共同应对这份工作。 「秀色可餐」的司府二少爷司狂澜首次登场，他与桃夭之间又会有着怎样的故事？","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-08-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":26,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kFPCMN8EC2CxntlbW1YKMDxdK2f.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kFPCMN8EC2CxntlbW1YKMDxdK2f.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/3/episode/5"},{"id":"3850801","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"云阳求桃夭帮忙给丁三四一个礼物，但却要云阳付出巨大的代价，这个礼物又与二少爷司狂澜有着什么样的联系？ 口是心非的桃夭在得知云阳与丁三四的过往后，答应请求加入圆梦小分队。 一会儿是牵线人，一会儿是送药君，甚至化为人形吹风机，看来桃夭的额外技能属性又增加了呀。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-08-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gI6SRc0suG4Tucz3PSuZkunQNCR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gI6SRc0suG4Tucz3PSuZkunQNCR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/3/episode/6"},{"id":"3893204","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"司府大少爷司静渊为何会被抬回府邸？ 虚耗与大少爷之间又会发生什么样的故事？ 在桃夭的帮助下，司静渊终于醒来，不料却言语行为如女子，还自称岳平川。 司狂澜迫于无奈答应了桃夭的要求，两人终于一起前往岳家探个究竟。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-08-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/md2ZlvfB3GN30ZcyN2RjLi7rTXy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/md2ZlvfB3GN30ZcyN2RjLi7rTXy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/3/episode/7"},{"id":"3919226","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"原来，岳平川是被一种叫虚耗的妖怪窃取欢心，桃夭和司狂澜能否消灭虚耗？ 自桃夭喜提打工人和牵线人称号之后，一个新的「查案人」称号也安排上了，桃夭联合司狂澜前往岳家巧妙破局，消灭恶妖虚耗的同时，司静渊和岳平川也脱离了危险，真是妙哉。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-09-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3liBYs2vmKZcQvm5cYi0Kt0l6N8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3liBYs2vmKZcQvm5cYi0Kt0l6N8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/3/episode/8"},{"id":"3935635","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"百妖谱记载，西极有云，云后有龙雀，似鸟似风，传为初风之子。 这龙雀为何会出现在司府厨房？ 性情各异的桃都一行人与司家兄弟能和平相处吗？ 凭借桃夭这个关系户进府的桃都一行人很快就安顿下来，司府也平添了不少烟火气息。 只是，前有柳公子炸厨房做饭，后有桃夭买古董被骗......","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-09-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":22,"rating":9.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jT4VYTVqVIRHAEDTVpMKHRuZDcu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jT4VYTVqVIRHAEDTVpMKHRuZDcu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/3/episode/9"},{"id":"3949932","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"自由自在的风神化身龙雀，因为一起事故被合成为阿龙的菜刀。 张伯与阿龙之间有哪些渊源？ 他的菜刀又为何会伴随张伯这么多年？ 真是一波未平一波又起，桃夭被骗之事还没着落，官府又因为兴祥斋老板一案跑到司府来拿人。 老张的过去总算画上了句号，只是换成了柳大厨，今后这司府的厨房怕是保不住了。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-09-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mtznet6gKA1ZAyHQZcgiiWclgDN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mtznet6gKA1ZAyHQZcgiiWclgDN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/3/episode/10"},{"id":"3963060","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"世事难料啊，老张走后这司府的厨房居然被柳公子接替了，连司狂澜都忍不住亲自下厨，只是苦了磨牙，为了一口吃的，竟然住进了鬼屋。 磨牙和滚滚意外住进鬼屋，遇到一只奇怪的小妖怪，一心只想和人牵牵手，磨牙与小妖怪傒囊之间会发生什么故事？ 桃夭又能否医好得了怪病的傒囊？","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-09-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/35uMiQ9t8OzoTZ3CcBJpKuOdVvb.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/35uMiQ9t8OzoTZ3CcBJpKuOdVvb.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/3/episode/11"},{"id":"3976475","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"傒囊终于等到了罗喜喜的赴约，她给它做饭，带它一起逛京师，可是磨牙却哭着说「一定是哪里出错了」，究竟这背后还有哪些隐情？ 磨牙从桃夭口中得知，娃娃是一只傒囊，并且一离开住地就会死，桃夭一行人忍着难过，多番努力下终于替它实现了关于罗喜喜的心愿。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-10-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":9.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9pBofpUaRtvTdvheNFzJ1Gg6ReT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9pBofpUaRtvTdvheNFzJ1Gg6ReT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/3/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/101099/season/3"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":17